      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Alright. Scoop up the last ones and lift off." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L5_outro",
      "type": "outro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 5,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Alright... I really hope the next one is the last, because that one rattled me." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "You say that after every mission." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah, but this time I actually mean it." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "The sector keeps getting more unstable." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Oh really? I hadn't noticed." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Stay focused, Mike. We're getting close to the end of the zone." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Captain?" },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Later, Rye. We'll talk if we survive this mess." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "W1_L6_intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 6,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "I'm confirming the readings... something's wrong." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "What do you mean?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "This looks bad. Way too many black ones." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "That bad?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Yes." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "What are we even supposed to recover again?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Not enough for my liking." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Great... so we wreck the ship for crumbs." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "We're already here." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Captain..." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "We take what's worth taking and we get out." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Understood." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah... this already sounds fantastic." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L6_phase0",
      "type": "phase",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 6,
      "phaseIndex": 0,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "PHASE 1" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L6_phase1",
      "type": "phase",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 6,
      "phaseIndex": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "PHASE 2" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L6_phase2",
      "type": "phase",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 6,
      "phaseIndex": 2,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "PHASE 3" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L6_evac",
      "type": "evac",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 6,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "That's enough. Grab what's left and get us the hell out of here." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L6_outro",
      "type": "outro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 6,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Alright... I'm gonna ask the question everyone's thinking." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Because that last sector..." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "felt a whole lot like a place we were meant to die in." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "The briefing data was accurate." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "What happened matched the readings." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah, I got that." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "That's exactly what worries me." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "..." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Rye?" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "..." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Talk." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "I don't know." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "All I know is, for thirty seconds I watched those trajectories coming in, and it felt like someone had sent us exactly where we needed to be if they wanted us not to make it out." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "And I don't like that feeling." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Statistically... it was a very bad mission." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "\"Bad\"?" },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "We nearly lost the ship for what... a handful of salvage?" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "..." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "And nobody thinks that's strange?" },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "We signed on to recover." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "But when exactly are we supposed to get paid?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "When they call us back." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "And when is that?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Six months." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Six months." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "So we go through sectors like that for six months..." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "and then maybe we get paid." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "..." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Rye?" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "I'm thinking." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Because I'm trying to figure something out." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "If someone wanted to send a crew out to get chewed up in some corner of space..." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "it would look a lot like what we just did." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "That's a hypothesis." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Reassuring." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "That's enough." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "We're still alive." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "The ship's still holding." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "And as long as that's true... we keep going." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

